t Allentown) and the 9/30 digest (Newark). These may be one ticket reopened or three different issues. I can't tell from the sources.\n- PD-8841 (4/27 digest) and #8841 may be the same ticket with a different prefix, or not. The 4/27 digest puts it on Nadia's account and the 5/4 digest puts #8841 on Gideon's.\n- The 3 Aug Hartford Sev 1 digest mentions no ticket number. The 2025-03-10 and 2025-12-01 digests have no Vantorre Group parent ticket numbers. The Mobility ticket #4812 is excluded.","thread_ts":"1792159200.000126"},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","ts":"1792159200.000127","thread_ts":"1792159200.000126"}}
